---
<section id="prosess" class="bg-slate-50 py-16 dark:bg-slate-950 lg:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-3 h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-brand-accent" data-animate></div>
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-brand-blue dark:text-white sm:text-4xl" data-animate data-delay="100">Slik jobber vi</h2>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-4">
      <div data-animate data-delay="0" class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
        <span class="inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-accent text-sm font-bold text-white">1</span>
        <h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Kartlegging</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Behov, risiko, modenhet og målbildet for virksomheten.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-animate data-delay="100" class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
        <span class="inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-accent text-sm font-bold text-white">2</span>
        <h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Design</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Løsningsdesign, styringsmodell og tydelig implementeringsplan.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-animate data-delay="200" class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
        <span class="inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-accent text-sm font-bold text-white">3</span>
        <h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Implementering</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Kontrollert gjennomføring med fokus på sikkerhet, stabilitet og verdi.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-animate data-delay="300" class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
        <span class="inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-accent text-sm font-bold text-white">4</span>
        <h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Videreutvikling</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Optimalisering, kompetanseoverføring og kontinuerlig forbedring.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
